# SwarmVault scaffolding. `swarmvault` (a global knowledge-vault CLI) drops a
# generic config, a schema template and five empty directories into whatever
# directory it is pointed at — it did so here on 2026-09-02, and the config is
# byte-identical to the one in ~/projetos. Nothing in this blog reads any of
# it. Ignored rather than deleted: the files belong to that tool, not to this
# repo, and removing another tool's state is its owner's call.
